      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p>
        Jongheon n8n Automation is a personal workflow automation application.
      </p>

      <p>
        The application may access Google Sheets and Google Drive data with
        the user's authorization.
      </p>

      <p>
        Google user data is used only to execute workflows configured by
        the user.
      </p>

      <p>
        Google user data is not sold, shared with third parties, or used
        for advertising purposes.
      </p>

      <p>
        OAuth credentials and necessary data may be processed on a privately
        managed n8n server for the purpose of running automated workflows.
      </p>

      <p>
        Users can revoke access at any time through their Google Account
        security settings.
      </p>

      <p>
